### Campus Events API - REST Client / Thunder Client Test Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Get All Events (Default Pagination: page=1, limit=5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events
Accept: application/json

### 2. Filter Events by Category (Technology)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=technology
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter Events by Publication Status (isPublished=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?isPublished=true
Accept: application/json

### 4. Sort and Paginate (sortBy=eventDate, order=asc, page=2, limit=2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=eventDate&order=asc&page=2&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Upcoming Events (Date >= today, sorted ascending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Existing Event by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101
Accept: application/json

### 7. Request Missing Event by ID (Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/not-real
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Sessions for an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Session Under Its Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions/ses-201
Accept: application/json

### 10. Create a Valid Event (Expected: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Intro to Cloud Computing",
  "description": "A beginner-friendly campus workshop.",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### 11. Create Event with Missing Title (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "A beginner-friendly campus workshop.",
  "location": "Engineering Block, Room 2",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-04T09:00:00.000Z",
  "category": "technology",
  "isPublished": true
}

### --- STRETCH CHALLENGES ---

### 12. Reject Unsupported Sort Field (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=invalidField
Accept: application/json

### 13. Search Query Matching Words in Title (search=bootcamp)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?search=bootcamp
Accept: application/json

### 14. Filter by Date Range (dateFrom & dateTo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?dateFrom=2026-11-01&dateTo=2026-11-30
Accept: application/json

### 15. Cross-Event Session Mismatch (Session exists but belongs to evt-102 -> Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/evt-101/sessions/ses-203
Accept: application/json

### 16. Get Published Events Only (Dedicated static route)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/published
Accept: application/json

